description: Package and feature folder public API boundaries
globs: packages/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Public API

- Package entry: `index.ts` only
- Export symbols siblings **consume**; don't export unused internals
- Import via segment public API (`@shared/ui`) — no deep paths (`@shared/ui/container`)
- Named imports — only symbols you use
- Feature entry: `feature/index.ts` — never import `model.ts` from outside
- Scope `@portfolio/*`, no deep paths

See `skills/rules/03-public-api.md`.
